# train_16: every pickup at A must satisfy one of two options for that
# pickup: reach inspection B one or two steps later and then eventually
# reach delivery bay C at/after that B; or reach overflow dock D at that
# pickup step or later. Different pickups may use different options.
# Vacuous if A never occurs.
(whenever A (either (within 1 2 B (then (visit C))) (visit D)))
